{
  "key": 29742,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_EggsFoundAtDayCare",
      "en_US": [
        "Every so often, an Egg will be found\n",
        "at the Pokémon Day Care.\r",
        "And they’re found without anyone\n",
        "knowing how they got there.\r",
        "It’s an enduring mystery.\n",
        "Is someone leaving them there?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_NotProvenPokemonLayEggs",
      "en_US": [
        "They say no one has ever seen\n",
        "a Pokémon actually lay an Egg.\r",
        "So, it hasn’t been proven that\n",
        "Pokémon actually lay Eggs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_2",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_3",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, welcome to the Utility Stop.\n",
        "My name is Strudel.\r",
        "Talk to my friends to see what’s\n",
        "for sale!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_4",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, my name is Imarti!\n",
        "I sell all sorts of berries.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_5",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, my name is Noghl!\n",
        "I sell evolution items.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_6",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, my name is Alaska!\n",
        "I sell a mish-mash of useful items.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_7",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_8",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_9",
      "en_US": [
        "Use LEFT and RIGHT to move 8 slots,\n",
        "or UP and DOWN to scroll."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_10",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh no, I can’t sell you anything.\r",
        "You need one of EACH of the\n",
        "following berries:\r",
        "Spelon, Pamtre, Watmel, and Durin.\n",
        "Oh, and bring me a Nomel.\r",
        "You should be able to find them\n",
        "on wild Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_11",
      "en_US": [
        "Awesome, you got all four berries!\n",
        "And a Nomel too!\r",
        "Great, now I can make a drink.\n",
        "I’m parched...time for Nomelade!\r",
        "Anyways, you’re all clear for the shop.\n",
        "Come by any time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_12",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh no, I can’t sell you anything.\r",
        "You need one of EACH of the\n",
        "following berries:\r",
        "Liechi, Ganlon, Salac, Petaya, Apicot,\n",
        "Jaboca aaaaand Rowap.\r",
        "You should be able to find them\n",
        "on wild Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_13",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah! The Petaya’s fleshy skin...\n",
        "The Rowap’s syzygial shapes...\r",
        "This will be a perfect topic for my\n",
        "Master’s thesis!\r",
        "Unovan Botanical Society, here I come!\r",
        "Oh, and you can buy from me.\n",
        "Enjoy!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_14",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? We’ve got plenty.\n",
        "$400 apiece, how many do you want?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_15",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? Always handy!\n",
        "$1,200 apiece, how many do you want?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_16",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? Ooh, that’s a good one.\n",
        "$5,000 apiece, how many do you want?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_17",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}? Good eye!\n",
        "$8,000 apiece, how many do you want?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_18",
      "en_US": "Come again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonTownNorthHouse_Text_19",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t have enough.\n",
        "Come again!"
      ]
    },
